From 5c309d9ff97a3027008a628dae803b1746ef5b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Murala S Swamy <ssmurala@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 21 May 2025 18:09:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [JSW-703] jgs: export arc region data to specs

with this patch, removed arc region declerations
from arcboot to specs for more visibility
to next stage firmware. here after any memory
region base address declerations can be defined
from arc region declarations from soc header.

Change-Id: I58973ebeb388bddf99c90591dae8d8ac8417bf3c
---

